{"id":"hrqpu0jksks374zk3v36p1vt5","title":"Linux内核vsyscall机制安全隐患及移除方案分析","originalTitle":"On vsyscalls and the vDSO (2011)","summary":"Linux内核移除vsyscall机制以增强安全性，但引发兼容性与性能争议。关键措施包括删除相关指令、将变量移至独立页并添加配置选项CONFIG_UNSAFE_VSYSCALLS。社区对选项名称存在激烈争论（Linus称其为'政治化命名'），最终方案可能影响旧版glibc用户的时间函数调用效率。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://lwn.net/Articles/446528/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T09:12:04.405Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-05T11:49:51.588Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-05T11:49:51.588Z","category":"security-privacy","tags":["技术方案","许可证变更","Linux"],"score":59,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"a1cf011f-1453-4d8c-afc7-d006abb06cc2","title":"Linux内核移除vsyscall机制引发兼容性争议"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"a1cf011f-1453-4d8c-afc7-d006abb06cc2","title":"Linux内核移除vsyscall机制引发兼容性争议"}],"topics":[{"slug":"linux","name":"Linux"},{"slug":"license-change","name":"许可证与治理"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fdTS2TpBroNc","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}